#% title
# is_primitive

#% text
# `is_primitive(G), (G, n)`: whether the group is transitive and has no nontrivial block system

#% section
# Details

#% item
# A transitive group is primitive when it preserves no partition of the points other than the trivial ones.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

